<title>THAILAND: IFCT unaudited Q3 profits rise.</title>
<headline>IFCT unaudited Q3 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Finance Corporation of Thailand said on Friday it posted unaudited profits of 718 million baht (US$28.7 million) for the third quarter of 1996, a 31 percent increase, over the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The bank said its net income for the nine months was 9.736 billion baht and unaudited profit for the first three quarters was now 2.295 million baht.</p>
<p>--(US$1 = 25 baht)</p>
</text>
